**Security decisions implemented:**
- Authentication via server-side session (Supabase `auth.getUser()`)
- Authorization with ownership predicate in WHERE clause (`.eq('owner_id', user.id)`)
- UUID validation prevents injection and enumeration
- 404 for non-owned documents to prevent resource enumeration
- Server-side storage access only (no client-side storage credentials)
- Filename sanitization for Content-Disposition header
- Structured error logging without sensitive data
- RLS policies ensure database-level security
